>, 3, R.2 <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>l.c</sup></lookup>.); <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מַצִּיג</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 6:37\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,37)\">Judg 6:37</ref> — <highlight>set, place</highlight>, with accusative: + <bdbheb>ב</bdbheb> location <ref ref=\"Gen 30:28\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(1,30,28)\">Gen 30:28</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; + <bdbheb>לְֹנכַח צאֹן</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Judg 6:37\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,37)\">Judg 6:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 8:27\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,27)\">Judg 8:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 6:17\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(10,6,17)\">2Sam 6:17</ref> ( + <bdbheb>בְּתוֺךְ</bdbheb>), with <bdbheb>בְּתוֺךְ</bdbheb> in || <ref ref=\"1Chr 16:1\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(13,16,1)\">1Chr 16:1</ref> + <bdbheb>אֵצֶל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 5:2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(9,5,2)\">1Sam 5:2</ref> of setting foot on (<bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb>) ground <ref ref=\"Deut 28:56\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"56\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"56\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,56)\">Deut 28:56</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 33:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,15)\">Gen 33:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; followed by <bdbheb>עִם</bdbheb>) = <highlight>station with</highlight> thee some of my retinue; + <bdbheb>לִפְנֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 43:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,43,9)\">Gen 43:9</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); so with idea of <highlight>presenting, introducing to</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 47:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,2)\">Gen 47:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); <highlight>set</highlight> (so that all may see) + <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 17:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,17,6)\">Job 17:6</ref> followed by 2 accusative ( = <highlight>set as</highlight>) <ref ref=\"Jer 51:34\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,34)\">Jer 51:34</ref> <bdbheb>וְהִצַּגְתִּיהָ כְּיוֺם הִוָָּֽלְדָ֑הּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 2:5\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(28,2,5)\">Hos 2:5</ref> <highlight>and</highlight> (lest) <highlight>I set</highlight> ( = <highlight>exhibit</highlight>) <highlight>her as in the day when she was born</highlight> (|| <bdbheb>אַפְשִׁיטֶנָּה עֲרֻמָּה</bdbheb>); figurative <highlight>set up, establish</highlight>, <bdbheb>הציגר בשׁער משׁפט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 5:15\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,15)\">Amos 5:15</ref> (opposed to v<ref ref=\"Amos 5:7\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,7)\">Amos 5:7</ref> <bdbheb>לארץ הניחו</bdbheb>). <b>Hoph`al</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יצָֻּ֑ג</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 10:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,10,24)\">Exod 10:24</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) <highlight>be stayed, stopped, detained</highlight> (of herds, etc.) </p></div><hr><p><bdbheb>יִצִהָר</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יִצְחָק</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יִצְחָר</bdbheb> see below <bdbheb>צהר</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>צהק</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>צחר</bdbheb> </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Jer 51:34", "book": "JER", "chapter": 51, "verse": 34}, {"raw": "Job 17:6", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 17, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Gen 43:9", "book": "GEN", "cha